<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian weekly forex demand falls to $36.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Nigerian weekly forex demand falls to $36.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigeria's central bank on Thursday announced sales of forex at its latest weekly auction held on Wednesday, July 9th:</p>
<p>				     9 July	   2 July</p>
<p> Amount sold		     $36.525 million   $37.789 million</p>
<p> Dollar exchange rate	  84.5 naira    84.5 naira</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
